book_benchmark: 2000000 operations, 5 repeats, median reported

implementation                        M ops/s  heap allocs   p50 ns   p99 ns  p99.9 ns      max ns
---------------------------------- ---------- ------------ -------- -------- --------- -----------
node-based, index unreserved             4.48      2864360      127      415       521    32256617
